# Stable spec ID: morgenthaler-amaretto-sour. Source checked 2026-10-12. Machine generated; not human reviewed.

::ingredients
(amaretto) 45 ml
(bourbon; cask-proof) 22.5 ml
(lemon: juice) 30 ml
(simple syrup, 2:1) 5 ml
(egg: white, lightly beaten) 15 ml

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(old-fashioned glass)
(immersion blender)

::instructions
[
    <shake, all measured ingredients without ice in (cocktail shaker)>
]
-OR-
[
    <blend, measured ingredients with (immersion blender) until combined and frothy>
]
<shake, with cracked ice>
<strain, onto fresh ice in (old-fashioned glass)>
Optional [
    <garnish, with lemon peel and brandied cherries>
]

::notes
The emphasis is cask-proof bourbon, not a specific brand; reader comments are excluded.
